{
  "name": "📋 Phase 3B — Manager Approval Sync Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 Phase 3B — Manager Approval Sync Workflow\n\n**Purpose:**\nThis workflow runs every 15 minutes and polls Supabase for any content rows in `Pending_Manager` status. For each pending row, it checks the corresponding Google Sheets row to see if the Digital Marketer has changed the status to `Manager_Approved`.\n\nIf approved:\n- It builds a clean UPSERT payload using human-edited copy from Sheets\n- It overwrites the AI draft in Supabase with the manager-approved version\n- If ALL 30 posts for a client are approved, it updates the Client status and notifies the Admin via Telegram\n- If only some posts are approved, it sends a partial approval notification\n\n**Trigger:** Every 15 minutes via Schedule node\n**Source of truth:** Supabase `Content_Calendar` table\n**Operational UI:** Google Sheets `Content Calendar` tab\n**Notification channel:** Telegram (Admin user)",
        "height": 944,
        "width": 2332,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -3632,
        1536
      ],
      "id": "5314b410-e03d-499c-a581-18f2b12f9dc0",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
